#!/usr/bin/env node
/* Tests for items 52c/52g (order-book depth: loader + TEST row figures from 52c; sell obstacles to target from 52g) - the shared snippet in radar.html and radar-test.html. Node + Playwright (chromium). No network:
   Run:  NODE_PATH=<dir containing playwright> node depth52-tests.js     Env: BOOK_DIR=<dir with book-core.js + book-codec.js>  CHROMIUM=<path>
   The snippet under test is extracted from the shipped pages (never copied here). Rolling-repo files come from fixtures/book/rolling (two REAL batches per venue,
   captured 2026-10-14 from rdwills02/BTC_Brief-data@rolling) or from synthetic trees built here with the book-core / book-codec modules. */
